    "# T5 Fine-tuning for Accessibility-Focused Text Simplification\n",
    "\n",
    "Fine-tunes **T5-small** specifically for neurodivergent accessibility needs (dyslexia, ADHD, autism).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Dataset Strategy\n",
    "Combines multiple simplification datasets with **accessibility weighting** to prioritize:\n",
    "- Shorter sentences (< 15 words)\n",
    "- High-frequency vocabulary (easier word recognition)\n",
    "- Concrete words (lower Age of Acquisition scores)\n",
    "- Simpler syntactic structures\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- Better reading comprehension for dyslexic users\n",
    "- Reduced cognitive load for ADHD users\n",
    "- More literal, concrete phrasing for autistic users\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before running:** Go to `Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Expected training time:** 2-3 hours for 8-10 epochs\n",
    "\n",
    "**Checkpoint:** Auto-saves best model every 1000 steps"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
