    "- `peft` — Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning (LoRA)\n",
    "- `sentencepiece` — T5 tokenizer backend\n",
    "- `accelerate` — GPU training utilities\n",
    "- `nltk` — For sentence tokenization and word frequency\n",
    "- `textstat` — For readability metrics\n",
    "- `evaluate` — For ROUGE evaluation metrics"
   ]
  },
