    "## Step 4 — Load and combine multiple simplification datasets\n",
    "\n",
    "Different datasets provide different perspectives on simplification:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Dataset | Strength | Size | Focus |\n",
    "|---------|----------|------|-------|\n",
    "| **WikiAuto** | Automated alignments | Large | General Wikipedia |\n",
    "| **Newsela** | Manual, grade-leveled | Medium | News articles |\n",
    "| **Asset** | Human-rated simplicity | Small | High quality |\n",
    "| **TurkCorpus** | Crowdsourced | Medium | Paraphrase variety |\n",
    "| **PWKP** | Aligned with metrics | Medium | Parallel data |\n",
    "\n",
    "We combine them for diversity, then filter for quality."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
